[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Identity
UID: APP-IDN
VERSION: 1.0.0
DATE: 2026-09-30
CLASSIFICATION: Internal
PREFIX: IDN-
ROOT: False

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: ../../grammar/org.sgra

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: Workforce and customer identity for Northline. Requirements refine the identity capabilities and the platform identity service.

[[SECTION]]
UID: IDN-SEC-ACC
PREFIX: ACC
TITLE: Access

[[SECTION]]
UID: IDN-SEC-AUTH
PREFIX: AUTH
TITLE: Authentication

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IDN-ACC-AUTH-001
TITLE: SMS one-time password
STATEMENT: Identity shall accept SMS as a second factor for a workforce account.
STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-ID-003
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: PLT-ID-001
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: IA-2

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IDN-ACC-AUTH-002
TITLE: Privileged sign-in
STATEMENT: Identity shall refuse a privileged session that did not use a phishing-resistant authenticator.
COMMENT: Replaces IDN-ACC-AUTH-001. The earlier requirement stays as approved.
STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-ID-003
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: PLT-ID-001
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: IDN-ACC-AUTH-001
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: IA-2.1
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: AC-6
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: V-222577

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IDN-ACC-AUTH-003
TITLE: Customer step-up
STATEMENT: Identity shall step up a customer session before showing payment instruments or health information.
STATUS: Active
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-ID-002
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: PLT-ID-002
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: IA-2
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: AC-3

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IDN-ACC-AUTH-004
TITLE: Lockout
STATEMENT: Identity shall temporarily lock an account after the configured number of failed attempts.
STATUS: Active
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-ID-006
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: PLT-ID-006
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: AC-7

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IDN-ACC-AUTH-005
TITLE: Authenticator recovery
STATEMENT: Identity shall recover a lost authenticator only after a second channel that is not the authenticator itself.
STATUS: Active
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-ID-001
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: PLT-ID-002
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: IA-5

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IDN-ACC-AUTH-006
TITLE: Replay
STATEMENT: Identity shall reject a reused authenticator response.
STATUS: Active
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-ID-001
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: PLT-ID-001
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: IA-2.8
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: V-222578

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IDN-ACC-AUTH-007
TITLE: Sign-out
STATEMENT: Identity shall revoke the session tokens when the user signs out.
STATUS: Active
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-ID-006
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: PLT-ID-006
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: AC-12

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IDN-ACC-AUTH-008
TITLE: Remembered device
STATEMENT: Identity shall bind a remembered browser to the customer and expire that binding.
STATUS: Draft
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-ID-002
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: PLT-ID-002
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: IA-3
[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
UID: IDN-SEC-AUTHZ
PREFIX: AUTHZ
TITLE: Authorization

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IDN-ACC-AUTHZ-001
TITLE: Role grant
STATEMENT: Identity shall grant an administrative role only from an approved request.
STATUS: Active
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-ID-003
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: PLT-ID-003
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: AC-2
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: AC-6

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IDN-ACC-AUTHZ-002
TITLE: Least privilege
STATEMENT: Identity shall not include an administrative role in a standard workforce profile.
STATUS: Active
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-ID-003
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: PLT-ID-001
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: AC-6

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IDN-ACC-AUTHZ-003
TITLE: Separation
STATEMENT: Identity shall stop one person from both requesting and approving the same privileged grant.
STATUS: Active
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-ID-003
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: PLT-ID-003
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: AC-5

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IDN-ACC-AUTHZ-004
TITLE: Temporary elevation
STATEMENT: Identity shall expire a temporary elevation at the time recorded on the request.
STATUS: Active
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-ID-007
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: PLT-ID-007
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: AC-2
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: AC-6
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: V-222585

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IDN-ACC-AUTHZ-005
TITLE: Access review
STATEMENT: Identity shall present privileged grants for review every quarter.
STATUS: Active
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-ID-003
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: PLT-ID-003
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: AC-2.9

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IDN-ACC-AUTHZ-006
TITLE: Deny by default
STATEMENT: Identity shall deny an action that no grant covers.
STATUS: Active
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-ID-001
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: PLT-ID-003
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: AC-3
[[/SECTION]]
[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
UID: IDN-SEC-PRV
PREFIX: PRV
TITLE: Provisioning

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IDN-PRV-001
TITLE: Hire feed
STATEMENT: Identity shall open a workforce account from the HR hire event and not from a free-text request.
STATUS: Active
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-ID-004
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: PLT-ID-003
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: AC-2
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: IA-4

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IDN-PRV-002
TITLE: Transfer
STATEMENT: Identity shall replace role grants when HR records a transfer.
STATUS: Active
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-ID-004
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: PLT-ID-003
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: AC-2

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IDN-PRV-003
TITLE: Departure
STATEMENT: Identity shall disable sign-in within one hour of a recorded departure.
STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-ID-004
