[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IDN-PRV-004
TITLE: Orphan account
STATEMENT: Identity shall list accounts that no longer match a person or a workload.
STATUS: Active
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-ID-008
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: PLT-ID-008
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: AC-2
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: IA-4

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IDN-PRV-005
TITLE: Service account owner
STATEMENT: Identity shall require a named owner on every service account.
STATUS: Active
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-ID-008
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: PLT-ID-008
- TYPE: Parent
