- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: IA-3

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IDN-PRV-006
TITLE: Dormant account
STATEMENT: Identity shall disable a workforce account with no successful sign-in for the configured period.
STATUS: Draft
RELATIONS:
